# Godot atomic-write temp files. Covers the editor's '~' backups and the
# scene/resource writer's leftovers (e.g. ~libspine_godot.dll~RF1a2b.TMP and
# BattleScene.tscn447100594.tmp). Both cases are matched, upper or lower.
~*
*.TMP
*.tmp

# Spine source projects (`<char_id>.spine`, `images/`, `audio/`). Kept out of the
# repo: the editor source is large and the game only loads the exports under
# Scenes/BattleUnit/Spine/. See Tools/spine/README.md.
SpineSource/

# gdUnit4 test reports: regenerated on every test run, never commit them
reports/
